\"事件及相關截圖在內地網路上瘋傳（微博截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521256570654720982135.jpeg/Cbhl5_nI3KCUijOtCzWOAKviHwAOxWV0Jpy9uSacvbk\"/><figcaption>事件及相關截圖在內地網路上瘋傳（微博截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事件及相關截圖在內地網路上瘋傳（微博截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521259066396672709183.png/tYoawdP2ngvtRk7EefQQf6bGVCgH7-gQTt-TBU7fkwU\"/><figcaption>事件及相關截圖在內地網路上瘋傳（微博截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521261402755072478052.jpeg/VeLMAtMNVfEn_uzQjyPEaaVHTsv7Ea5Cki5gZJIuYGQ\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521263328071680642813.jpeg/CcPh5IbeszzSFLas5qy3dMGDa_liatuJYQ7-TmEO_k4\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521265316302848180475.jpeg/SzacgVqLPCAuTBSYpAIH_Tirvtc5JI19dvUcqXb1HKk\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521267518443520918346.jpeg/PEbKf7pmzpJ8KVsFOtBeBmCCRObDCHQJGsJhHxrCYR8\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521269561200640256480.jpeg/27vb5sgsvaDJngQNXS71bxzaXmiTz6qeTLSArky0gK4\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230113/690521271507488768563897.jpeg/XjK4Haywwb5pKIZp8vQjg2Gmt8nPDwTlNPYc-TT2HPk\"/><figcaption>瘋傳江西海歸女索6388萬禮金遭富貴男友悔婚崩潰（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「日本物語」授權轉載，微信公眾號：Japanch】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T07:38:24.151788+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":4121,"images":53,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}